OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA clear
OL,6,Fnight for much of the region and with
OL,7,Flight winds temperatures will fall
OL,8,Faway quickly. Some patchy cloud
OL,9,Fperhaps developing late in the night
OL,10,Fbut remaining dry. Chance of a local
OL,11,Ffrost in rural areas around dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FFine and bright after a
OL,14,Fchilly start. The best of the hazy
OL,15,Fsunshine across eastern areas. Feeling
OL,16,Fwarmer by the afternoon, but with a
OL,17,Fstrengthening breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
