OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudier
OL,6,Fwith some rain Friday. Drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter over the weekend with some
OL,8,Fsunny or clear spells, although breezy
OL,9,Fat times. Temperatures near or
OL,10,Fslightly above normal.
